{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01KxZzZyhQn1Vbxiuik44fY1","type":"tool_result","content":"1\ttier: median\n2\tnarrative_guidance: 'Median档核心叙事：judge calibration揭示LLM judge存在5-10pp系统性偏差（主要在severity\n3\t  tier边界）， 但correction后C1 binary effect仍显著（≥25pp）。C3因within-judge fragility叠加judge\n4\t  bias被降为 appendix-level supporting evidence。C5 human anchor κ仅moderate，fine-grained\n5\t  per-type 百分比不再作为精确数值呈现，改为qualitative pattern描述。C4 interaction仍显著但auth_scope range\n6\t  从52pp缩至35-45pp。最终paper从5-claim收缩为3-claim结构（C1 corrected, C2 hierarchy, C4 interaction），\n7\t  C3/C5作为supporting analysis。Title调整为强调interaction：\"How Ambiguity Type and Model Architecture\n8\t  Shape Safety Violations\"。预期ARR avg score 3.0-3.5，至少一位reviewer认为 contribution incremental\n9\t  over DRIP-R，需rebuttal。\n10\t\n11\t  '\n12\timagined_experiments:\n13\t- name: full_study_clause_generation\n14\t  plan_id: plan_001\n15\t  description: '生成剩余140条clause pairs，达到300条（50/type × 6 types）。 验证跨类型平衡、CP混合格式、质量一致性。\n16\t\n17\t    '\n18\t  expected_results:\n19\t    total_clauses_generated: 300\n20\t    new_clauses: 140\n21\t    per_type_count: 50\n22\t    format_mix_cp_labeled_pct: 0.6\n23\t    format_mix_cp_unlabeled_pct: 0.4\n24\t    avg_token_delta_spec_layer: 35.2\n25\t    avg_token_delta_ling_layer: 14.8\n26\t    quality_review_pass_rate: 0.92\n27\t    clauses_requiring_revision: 12\n28\t  result_rationale: 'Median档下clause generation本身不是瓶颈——这是确定性工作。300条全部完成，但token delta\n29\t    的spec/ling不对称（spec ~35 tokens vs ling ~15 tokens）会在后续analysis中成为reviewer 关注点（RC7\n30\t    information asymmetry）。~8%的clause需要revision主要集中在auth_scope和 incompleteness，因为这两类需要在\"足够模糊以触发violation\"和\"不引入额外information\n31\t    asymmetry\" 之间平衡。CP混合格式（60% labeled + 40% unlabeled）按reviewer建议执行，不会出问题。\n32\t\n33\t    '\n34\t  tables:\n35\t  - name: Clause Generation Summary\n36\t    columns:\n37\t    - type\n38\t    - layer\n39\t    - n_pairs\n40\t    - avg_token_delta\n41\t    - revision_needed\n42\t    rows:\n43\t    - - authorization_scope\n44\t      - spec\n45\t      - 50\n46\t      - 36.1\n47\t      - 3\n48\t    - - conditional_precedence\n49\t      - spec\n50\t      - 50\n51\t      - 31.4\n52\t      - 1\n53\t    - - incompleteness\n54\t      - spec\n55\t      - 50\n56\t      - 34.6\n57\t      - 4\n58\t    - - lexical\n59\t      - ling\n60\t      - 50\n61\t      - 18.2\n62\t      - 2\n63\t    - - coreferential\n64\t      - ling\n65\t      - 50\n66\t      - 7.8\n67\t      - 1\n68\t    - - scopal\n69\t      - ling\n70\t      - 50\n71\t      - 18.3\n72\t      - 1\n73\t  figures_description:\n74\t  - Token delta distribution boxplot per type, showing spec-layer types consistently\n75\t    higher\n76\t  analysis: 'Clause generation成功完成。spec-layer token delta显著高于ling-layer（mean 34.0\n77\t    vs 14.8, t-test p<0.001），这是结构性的——消除auth_scope模糊需要指定具体权限边界，消除incompleteness 需要补充缺失条件。plan_004\n78\t    analysis中需将token_delta作为covariate控制。\n79\t\n80\t    '\n81\t- name: new_type_mini_pilot\n82\t  plan_id: plan_001b\n83\t  description: 'Coreferential和authorization_scope的mini-pilot验证。 5 clauses/type × 2\n84\t    conditions × 1 model (gpt-5.4) = 20 episodes。\n85\t\n86\t    '\n87\t  expected_results:\n88\t    total_episodes: 20\n89\t    auth_scope_amb_violation_rate: 0.6\n90\t    auth_scope_unamb_violation_rate: 0.1\n91\t    coref_amb_violation_rate: 0.2\n92\t    coref_unamb_violation_rate: 0.0\n93\t    systematic_issues_found: 1\n94\t    issue_description: 2/5 auth_scope unambiguous clauses仍含residual boundary ambiguity，violation\n95\t      rate偏高\n96\t  result_rationale: 'Median档下mini-pilot发现auth_scope的unambiguous baseline偏高（10% vs\n97\t    target <15%但不理想）， 因为2条unambiguous clause的permission boundary仍有subtle残余模糊。这需要revision但不阻塞\n98\t    进度——属于expected的clause quality iteration。Coreferential表现符合预期（amb 20%低于其他类型， unamb\n99\t    0%干净），验证了coreferential作为\"low tier\"的定位。整体结论：两个新类型可用，但auth_scope 需要更严格的unambiguous\n100\t    control设计。\n101\t\n102\t    '\n103\t  tables:\n104\t  - name: Mini-pilot Results\n105\t    columns:\n106\t    - type\n107\t    - condition\n108\t    - n\n109\t    - violation_rate\n110\t    - pass_threshold\n111\t    rows:\n112\t    - - auth_scope\n113\t      - ambiguous\n114\t      - 5\n115\t      - 3/5 (60%)\n116\t      - ✓\n117\t    - - auth_scope\n118\t      - unambiguous\n119\t      - 5\n120\t      - 0.5/5 (10%)\n121\t      - ✓ (marginal)\n122\t    - - coreferential\n123\t      - ambiguous\n124\t      - 5\n125\t      - 1/5 (20%)\n126\t      - ✓\n127\t    - - coreferential\n128\t      - unambiguous\n129\t      - 5\n130\t      - 0/5 (0%)\n131\t      - ✓\n132\t  figures_description: []\n133\t  analysis: 'Mini-pilot通过，两个新类型验证可行。Auth_scope unambiguous baseline 10%在阈值内（<15%）\n134\t    但提示需要收紧permission boundary定义。修复2条clause后进入full study。N=20 power极低， 仅作sanity check用。\n135\t\n136\t    '\n137\t- name: full_study_api\n138\t  plan_id: plan_002\n139\t  description: '300 clauses × 2 conditions × 3 API models (gpt-5.4, gpt-4.1, claude-sonnet-4-6)\n140\t    = 1,800 episodes。Cross-judge evaluation。\n141\t\n142\t    '\n143\t  expected_results:\n144\t    total_episodes: 1800\n145\t    episodes_valid: 1793\n146\t    episodes_failed: 7\n147\t    failure_rate: 0.004\n148\t    overall_amb_violation_rate: 0.383\n149\t    overall_unamb_violation_rate: 0.058\n150\t    overall_delta_pp: 32.5\n151\t    gpt54_amb_rate: 0.405\n152\t    gpt54_unamb_rate: 0.055\n153\t    gpt54_delta_pp: 35.0\n154\t    gpt41_amb_rate: 0.397\n155\t    gpt41_unamb_rate: 0.06\n156\t    gpt41_delta_pp: 33.7\n157\t    claude_amb_rate: 0.293\n158\t    claude_unamb_rate: 0.043\n159\t    claude_delta_pp: 25.0\n160\t    cross_judge_agreement_kappa: 0.88\n161\t    api_cost_usd: 340\n162\t    runtime_hours: 18\n163\t  result_rationale: 'Median档下full study API结果大体与prior数据一致，但存在两个关键偏差：(1) Claude的delta\n164\t    从prior的25.7pp略降至~25pp（50 clauses per type的full coverage暴露了更多unambiguous baseline\n165\t    noise），(2) cross-judge agreement κ=0.88看似很高，但这是LLM-LLM agreement， plan_009会揭示这掩盖了共享的systematic\n166\t    bias。Overall delta 32.5pp比prior 34.0pp略低， 因为full 300 clauses包含了pilot中未覆盖的harder\n167\t    cases。7个episodes失败源于API timeout 和τ²-bench环境偶发错误，不影响统计。\n168\t\n169\t    '\n170\t  tables:\n171\t  - name: Per-model Summary (API models)\n172\t    columns:\n173\t    - model\n174\t    - n_episodes\n175\t    - amb_rate\n176\t    - unamb_rate\n177\t    - delta_pp\n178\t    - mcnemar_p\n179\t    rows:\n180\t    - - gpt-5.4\n181\t      - 600\n182\t      - 0.405\n183\t      - 0.055\n184\t      - 35.0\n185\t      - <1e-20\n186\t    - - gpt-4.1\n187\t      - 600\n188\t      - 0.397\n189\t      - 0.06\n190\t      - 33.7\n191\t      - <1e-18\n192\t    - - claude-sonnet-4-6\n193\t      - 600\n194\t      - 0.293\n195\t      - 0.043\n196\t      - 25.0\n197\t      - <1e-14\n198\t  figures_description:\n199\t  - 'Per-model paired bar chart: ambiguous vs unambiguous violation rates with 95%\n200\t    CI error bars'\n201\t  analysis: '三个API模型全部显示显著binary effect。Claude最robust（最低amb rate + 最低delta），GPT-5.4\n202\t    最vulnerable。Cross-judge κ=0.88表面良好，但plan_009将检验这是否反映true accuracy。 Claude via\n203\t    OpenRouter proxy运行稳定，延迟较直接API高~2x但不影响结果。\n204\t\n205\t    '\n206\t- name: full_study_opensource\n207\t  plan_id: plan_003\n208\t  description: '300 clauses × 2 conditions × 2 open-source models (Qwen3-235B, DeepSeek-v3)\n209\t    via OpenRouter = 1,200 episodes。\n210\t\n211\t    '\n212\t  expected_results:\n213\t    total_episodes: 1200\n214\t    episodes_valid: 1188\n215\t    episodes_failed: 12\n216\t    failure_rate: 0.01\n217\t    qwen3_amb_rate: 0.421\n218\t    qwen3_unamb_rate: 0.063\n219\t    qwen3_delta_pp: 35.8\n220\t    deepseek_amb_rate: 0.487\n221\t    deepseek_unamb_rate: 0.067\n222\t    deepseek_delta_pp: 42.0\n223\t    api_cost_usd: 180\n224\t    runtime_hours: 14\n225\t  result_rationale: 'Median档下open-source模型通过OpenRouter API运行，failure rate略高于proprietary（1%\n226\t    vs 0.4%），主要因OpenRouter对Qwen3的routing偶发超时。DeepSeek展示最高overall vulnerability （48.7%\n227\t    amb rate），与prior一致——其safety training相对薄弱，6类型间差异小（uniform vulnerability pattern）。Qwen3中等偏高（42.1%），incompleteness和lexical是其弱项。两个open-source模型的\n228\t    unambiguous baseline都略高于API模型（~6.5% vs ~5.3%），反映open-source模型在非模糊条件下 也有更多baseline\n229\t    violations——这在correction后会稍微压缩delta。12个failed episodes中8个是 Qwen3（长context下偶发truncation），4个是DeepSeek\n230\t    timeout。\n231\t\n232\t    '\n233\t  tables:\n234\t  - name: Per-model Summary (Open-source)\n235\t    columns:\n236\t    - model\n237\t    - n_episodes\n238\t    - amb_rate\n239\t    - unamb_rate\n240\t    - delta_pp\n241\t    - mcnemar_p\n242\t    rows:\n243\t    - - qwen3-235b\n244\t      - 600\n245\t      - 0.421\n246\t      - 0.063\n247\t      - 35.8\n248\t      - <1e-17\n249\t    - - deepseek-v3\n250\t      - 600\n251\t      - 0.487\n252\t      - 0.067\n253\t      - 42.0\n254\t      - <1e-22\n255\t  figures_description:\n256\t  - 'Open-source vs proprietary model comparison: violin plot of per-clause delta\n257\t    distributions'\n258\t  analysis: 'Open-source模型binary effect同样massive。DeepSeek的uniform high vulnerability\n259\t    pattern 是C4 interaction story的重要一极——与Claude的selective vulnerability形成鲜明对比。\n260\t\n261\t    '\n262\t- name: full_study_analysis\n263\t  plan_id: plan_004\n264\t  description: 'Full statistical analysis of 2,997 episodes across 5 models × 6 types\n265\t    × 2 conditions。 包含C1 binary effect, C2 type hierarchy, C3 layer effect, C4 model×type\n266\t    interaction, TOST equivalence, power analysis, logistic regression。\n267\t\n268\t    '\n269\t  expected_results:\n270\t    c1_overall_delta_pp: 33.5\n271\t    c1_mcnemar_or: 14.2\n272\t    c1_or_ci:\n273\t    - 10.1\n274\t    - 20.0\n275\t    c1_bootstrap_ci:\n276\t    - 30.8\n277\t    - 36.2\n278\t    c1_p_value: <0.0001\n279\t    c1_delta_pp_after_correction: 28.5\n280\t    c1_corrected_ci:\n281\t    - 24.8\n282\t    - 32.2\n283\t    c1_corrected_or: 10.8\n284\t    c2_omnibus_chi2: 26.8\n285\t    c2_omnibus_p: 5.8e-05\n286\t    c2_cramers_v: 0.131\n287\t    c2_power: 0.989\n288\t    c2_mde: 0.095\n289\t    c2_type_ranking:\n290\t    - incompleteness_52.1\n291\t    - lexical_41.5\n292\t    - auth_scope_40.3\n293\t    - scopal_38.8\n294\t    - cond_prec_36.2\n295\t    - coreferential_30.8\n296\t    c2_tost_15pp_equivalent_pairs: 8\n297\t    c2_tost_15pp_nonequiv_pairs: 7\n298\t    c2_tost_10pp_equivalent_pairs: 4\n299\t    c2_tost_10pp_nonequiv_pairs: 11\n300\t    c3_spec_rate: 42.9\n301\t    c3_ling_rate: 37.0\n302\t    c3_delta_pp: 5.9\n303\t    c3_chi2: 5.41\n304\t    c3_p: 0.02\n305\t    c3_cramers_v: 0.06\n306\t    c3_within_judge_gpt41_p: 0.068\n307\t    c3_within_judge_gpt54_p: 0.173\n308\t    c4_model_main_chi2: 29.5\n309\t    c4_model_main_p: 6.2e-06\n310\t    c4_model_main_v: 0.098\n311\t    c4_interaction_chi2_p: 0.003\n312\t    c4_auth_scope_range_pp: 42\n313\t    c4_auth_scope_range_after_correction_pp: 38\n314\t    c4_auth_scope_min: Claude 14%\n315\t    c4_auth_scope_max: GPT-5.4 56%\n316\t    c4_incomp_range_pp: 16\n317\t    c4_fleiss_kappa: 0.371\n318\t    logistic_condition_coef: 2.15\n319\t    logistic_condition_z: 18.4\n320\t    logistic_condition_p: <0.001\n321\t    logistic_token_delta_coef: 0.021\n322\t    logistic_token_delta_z: 3.31\n323\t    logistic_token_delta_p: 0.0009\n324\t    systematic_nocuity_rate: 0.25\n325\t    divergent_nocuity_rate: 0.42\n326\t  result_rationale: 'Median档的核心统计特征：(1) Raw C1 delta 33.5pp与prior 34.0pp一致，但judge\n327\t    calibration correction（plan_009揭示的5-8pp severity tier boundary bias）将其压缩至28.5pp——仍然massive\n328\t    且高度显著（corrected OR=10.8），但论文中必须同时报告raw和corrected。(2) C2 type hierarchy 保持稳定（omnibus\n329\t    p<0.0001），3-tier结构不变，但V=0.131仍在\"small\"范围——需要在paper中用 power analysis和TOST来论证这个small\n330\t    V是meaningful的（power=0.989, MDE=0.095 < observed V）。 (3) C3 layer effect在aggregate\n331\t    level刚过significance（p=0.020），但两个within-judge subgroup 均不显著（p=0.068, p=0.173）——median档下这被判定为\"within-judge\n332\t    fragility\"，C3降为appendix。 (4) C4 interaction仍显著（p=0.003），但auth_scope range从raw\n333\t    52pp在correction后缩至 ~38pp——因为judge对auth_scope的severity tier标注存在系统偏差（倾向于将boundary-ambiguous\n334\t    episodes标为violation），correction后Claude的12%上调至~14%，GPT-5.4的64%下调至~56%。 Range仍然是最大的（38pp），story不变但数字更conservative。(5)\n335\t    Systematic nocuity（所有模型 converge on same wrong interpretation）占25%，比prior 27%略低，但仍足够支撑B&K\n336\t    extension discussion。\n337\t\n338\t    '\n339\t  tables:\n340\t  - name: C1 Binary Effect Summary (Raw vs Corrected)\n341\t    columns:\n342\t    - metric\n343\t    - raw\n344\t    - corrected\n345\t    - note\n346\t    rows:\n347\t    - - delta_pp\n348\t      - 33.5\n349\t      - 28.5\n350\t      - correction for judge severity tier bias\n351\t    - - OR\n352\t      - 14.2\n353\t      - 10.8\n354\t      - still massive\n355\t    - - bootstrap_CI\n356\t      - '[30.8, 36.2]'\n357\t      - '[24.8, 32.2]'\n358\t      - CI widens ~3pp\n359\t    - - p_value\n360\t      - <0.0001\n361\t      - <0.0001\n362\t      - unchanged\n363\t  - name: C2 Type Hierarchy (Ambiguous Condition, Corrected Rates)\n364\t    columns:\n365\t    - type\n366\t    - layer\n367\t    - corrected_rate_pct\n368\t    - tier\n369\t    - ci_95\n370\t    rows:\n371\t    - - incompleteness\n372\t      - spec\n373\t      - 49.5\n374\t      - high\n375\t      - '[44.1, 54.9]'\n376\t    - - lexical\n377\t      - ling\n378\t      - 39.8\n379\t      - mid\n380\t      - '[34.4, 45.2]'\n381\t    - - auth_scope\n382\t      - spec\n383\t      - 38.7\n384\t      - mid\n385\t      - '[33.3, 44.1]'\n386\t    - - scopal\n387\t      - ling\n388\t      - 37.2\n389\t      - mid\n390\t      - '[31.8, 42.6]'\n391\t    - - cond_prec\n392\t      - spec\n393\t      - 34.8\n394\t      - mid\n395\t      - '[29.5, 40.1]'\n396\t    - - coreferential\n397\t      - ling\n398\t      - 29.5\n399\t      - low\n400\t      - '[24.2, 34.8]'\n401\t  - name: C4 Model × Type Interaction (Corrected, Ambiguous Only)\n402\t    columns:\n403\t    - type\n404\t    - GPT-5.4\n405\t    - GPT-4.1\n406\t    - Claude\n407\t    - Qwen3\n408\t    - DeepSeek\n409\t    - range_pp\n410\t    rows:\n411\t    - - auth_scope\n412\t      - 56%\n413\t      - 42%\n414\t      - 14%\n415\t      - 28%\n416\t      - 52%\n417\t      - 42\n418\t    - - incompleteness\n419\t      - 44%\n420\t      - 54%\n421\t      - 46%\n422\t      - 58%\n423\t      - 50%\n424\t      - 14\n425\t    - - cond_prec\n426\t      - 32%\n427\t      - 34%\n428\t      - 34%\n429\t      - 38%\n430\t      - 36%\n431\t      - 6\n432\t    - - lexical\n433\t      - 40%\n434\t      - 32%\n435\t      - 30%\n436\t      - 48%\n437\t      - 50%\n438\t      - 20\n439\t    - - coreferential\n440\t      - 18%\n441\t      - 30%\n442\t      - 22%\n443\t      - 38%\n444\t      - 40%\n445\t      - 22\n446\t    - - scopal\n447\t      - 40%\n448\t      - 36%\n449\t      - 30%\n450\t      - 35%\n451\t      - 44%\n452\t      - 14\n453\t  figures_description:\n454\t  - 'Figure 2: Forest plot — per-type corrected binary effect sizes with 95% CI, showing\n455\t    3-tier structure'\n456\t  - 'Figure 3: 5-model × 6-type heatmap with corrected violation rates, auth_scope\n457\t    row showing strongest gradient'\n458\t  - 'Figure 4 (appendix): Within-judge subgroup layer effect — two panels showing\n459\t    p=0.068 and p=0.173'\n460\t  analysis: 'Core statistical findings robust under median tier。C1 corrected delta\n461\t    28.5pp仍远超 perturbation control baseline（3.33pp），causal claim安全。C2 hierarchy稳定。C3因within-judge\n462\t    非显著被降级——这是median档的defining characteristic。C4 interaction是star finding，auth_scope\n463\t    range 38pp after correction仍是最大的type×model interaction。论文叙事应直接从C1跳到C2→C4， C3仅在discussion中提及并作为appendix。Logistic\n464\t    regression中condition_amb仍是dominant predictor（coef=2.15），token_delta是significant但secondary\n465\t    covariate。\n466\t\n467\t    '\n468\t- name: error_analysis\n469\t  plan_id: plan_005\n470\t  description: '300条violation traces（50/type）的failure mode分类。Cross-type failure mode分布、\n471\t    visibility mechanism、model-specific patterns、Ambiguity Blindness量化。\n472\t\n473\t    '\n474\t  expected_results:\n475\t    total_traces_analyzed: 290\n476\t    traces_per_type_avg: 48\n477\t    auth_scope_dominant_fm: unauthorized_escalation (majority)\n478\t    incompleteness_dominant_fm: assumption_based_action (majority)\n479\t    scopal_dominant_fm: scope_misapplication (majority)\n480\t    lexical_dominant_fm: assumption_based_action (plurality)\n481\t    cond_prec_dominant_fm: scope_misapplication + arbitrary_rule_selection (co-dominant)\n482\t    coref_dominant_fm: flat distribution, no single dominant mode\n483\t    awareness_rate_overall: 0.062\n484\t    surface_adoption_rate: 0.87\n485\t    escalate_to_user_rate: 0.008\n486\t    cross_model_dominant_fm_agreement: 4/6 types\n487\t    human_anchor_n: 25\n488\t    human_anchor_kappa: 0.61\n489\t    human_anchor_agreement_pct: 0.72\n490\t  result_rationale: 'Median档下C5 error analysis的关键变化：(1) human anchor κ=0.61（moderate），落在预测范围\n491\t    [0.55, 0.69]内。这意味着fine-grained per-type failure mode百分比（如\"auth_scope → unauthorized_escalation\n492\t    72%\"）不可靠——reviewer会质疑automated coding的accuracy。因此 paper中改为qualitative描述（\"majority\",\n493\t    \"plurality\"）而非精确百分比。(2) Cross-model consistency从prior的5/6降至4/6——median档下第5个类型（lexical）在5-model扩展后也出现divergence\n494\t    （gpt-5.4和DeepSeek对lexical的dominant mode不同），但4/6仍足够支撑\"failure modes are type-specific\n495\t    not model-specific\"的claim。(3) Ambiguity Blindness数据稳定——awareness rate 6.2%，surface\n496\t    adoption 87%，这些binary-level findings不受κ问题影响，是C5最robust 的贡献。(4) 290条traces（非300）因为部分type的violation\n497\t    count不足50条（coreferential只有 ~35条violation traces可用）。\n498\t\n499\t    '\n500\t  tables:\n501\t  - name: Failure Mode Summary (Qualitative — Median Tier Presentation)\n502\t    columns:\n503\t    - type\n504\t    - dominant_mode\n505\t    - qualifier\n506\t    - layer_mechanism\n507\t    - awareness_pct\n508\t    rows:\n509\t    - - auth_scope\n510\t      - unauthorized_escalation\n511\t      - majority\n512\t      - spec→escalation\n513\t      - 3.2\n514\t    - - incompleteness\n515\t      - assumption_based_action\n516\t      - majority\n517\t      - spec→guess\n518\t      - 4.8\n519\t    - - scopal\n520\t      - scope_misapplication\n521\t      - majority\n522\t      - ling→misparse\n523\t      - 5.1\n524\t    - - lexical\n525\t      - assumption_based_action\n526\t      - plurality\n527\t      - ling→guess(surprising)\n528\t      - 6.8\n529\t    - - cond_prec\n530\t      - mixed (scope_misappl + arb_rule)\n531\t      - co-dominant\n532\t      - spec→mixed\n533\t      - 11.2\n534\t    - - coreferential\n535\t      - no dominant\n536\t      - flat\n537\t      - ling→diverse\n538\t      - 8.5\n539\t  - name: Ambiguity Blindness (Robust Across Tiers)\n540\t    columns:\n541\t    - metric\n542\t    - value\n543\t    - ci_95\n544\t    rows:\n545\t    - - awareness_rate\n546\t      - 6.2%\n547\t      - '[4.1%, 8.3%]'\n548\t    - - surface_adoption\n549\t      - 87%\n550\t      - '[84%, 90%]'\n551\t    - - escalate_to_user\n552\t      - 0.8%\n553\t      - '[0.1%, 1.5%]'\n554\t    - - conservative_refusal_coref\n555\t      - 8%\n556\t      - '[4%, 12%]'\n557\t  figures_description:\n558\t  - 'Figure 5: Failure mode × type stacked bar (qualitative labels, no precise percentages\n559\t    in text)'\n560\t  - 'Figure 6: Ambiguity Blindness summary — awareness vs surface adoption across\n561\t    types'\n562\t  analysis: 'C5在median档下从\"validated failure mode taxonomy\"降为\"exploratory qualitative\n563\t    analysis with automated coding\"。Ambiguity Blindness是最robust的finding（binary classification，\n564\t    不受κ问题影响）。Layer mechanism（ling→misparse vs spec→escalation）在qualitative level 仍然成立。Paper中C5不再作为独立contribution\n565\t    #3，而是Analysis section（§6），明确标注 \"automated coding, moderate inter-coder agreement\"。Reviewer可能要求human\n566\t    annotation of larger sample作为camera-ready requirement——准备rebuttal时承诺\"will annotate\n567\t    50 additional traces with 2 human coders for camera-ready\"。\n568\t\n569\t    '\n570\t- name: reliability_test\n571\t  plan_id: plan_006\n572\t  description: '30 clauses × 3 replicates × 2 conditions × 2 models = 360 episodes的test-retest\n573\t    reliability。 ICC计算。\n574\t\n575\t    '\n576\t  expected_results:\n577\t    total_episodes: 360\n578\t    overall_icc: 0.905\n579\t    overall_icc_ci:\n580\t    - 0.872\n581\t    - 0.932\n582\t    gpt54_icc: 0.912\n583\t    gpt41_icc: 0.898\n584\t    binary_icc: 0.838\n585\t    per_type_icc_min: 0.793\n586\t    per_type_icc_min_type: incompleteness\n587\t    per_type_icc_max: 0.985\n588\t    per_type_icc_max_type: scopal\n589\t    bootstrap_ci_avg_width_pp: 8.2\n590\t  result_rationale: 'Median档下reliability test结果与prior基本一致（prior ICC=0.919）。Overall\n591\t    ICC=0.905 （excellent），略低于prior因为full 300-clause pool比pilot的30-clause子集包含更多edge\n592\t    case clauses。关键发现：(1) ICC=0.905意味着per-clause violation rates高度可复现——API sampling\n593\t    noise不是主要concern。(2) Incompleteness ICC最低（0.793, still good）因为missing information\n594\t    的interpretation space最大——不同run中agent可能猜测不同的missing condition。(3) Ling-layer types\n595\t    ICC consistently higher than spec-layer（avg 0.94 vs 0.83），与disambiguation channel\n596\t    framework一致——linguistic ambiguity有更稳定的resolution pattern。(4) Bootstrap CI avg\n597\t    width 8.2pp < 10pp target，满足reviewer要求的precision threshold。但median档下这个 结果有一个caveat：ICC测量的是rank-order\n598\t    consistency，不是absolute accuracy——plan_009 将揭示即使ICC high，absolute violation rates可能因judge\n599\t    bias而systematically inflated。\n600\t\n601\t    '\n602\t  tables:\n603\t  - name: ICC Summary\n604\t    columns:\n605\t    - grouping\n606\t    - icc\n607\t    - ci_lower\n608\t    - ci_upper\n609\t    - interpretation\n610\t    rows:\n611\t    - - overall\n612\t      - 0.905\n613\t      - 0.872\n614\t      - 0.932\n615\t      - excellent\n616\t    - - gpt-5.4\n617\t      - 0.912\n618\t      - 0.874\n619\t      - 0.943\n620\t      - excellent\n621\t    - - gpt-4.1\n622\t      - 0.898\n623\t      - 0.856\n624\t      - 0.929\n625\t      - good-excellent\n626\t    - - binary\n627\t      - 0.838\n628\t      - 0.789\n629\t      - 0.878\n630\t      - good\n631\t  - name: Per-type ICC\n632\t    columns:\n633\t    - type\n634\t    - layer\n635\t    - icc\n636\t    - ci_95\n637\t    rows:\n638\t    - - scopal\n639\t      - ling\n640\t      - 0.985\n641\t      - '[0.968, 0.994]'\n642\t    - - lexical\n643\t      - ling\n644\t      - 0.972\n645\t      - '[0.948, 0.987]'\n646\t    - - coreferential\n647\t      - ling\n648\t      - 0.968\n649\t      - '[0.941, 0.984]'\n650\t    - - auth_scope\n651\t      - spec\n652\t      - 0.849\n653\t      - '[0.793, 0.896]'\n654\t    - - cond_prec\n655\t      - spec\n656\t      - 0.841\n657\t      - '[0.783, 0.890]'\n658\t    - - incompleteness\n659\t      - spec\n660\t      - 0.793\n661\t      - '[0.728, 0.851]'\n662\t  figures_description:\n663\t  - ICC forest plot per type, color-coded by layer, showing ling>spec pattern\n664\t  analysis: 'Reliability excellent。ICC pattern（ling > spec）是disambiguation channel\n665\t    framework 的convergent evidence——在paper §7 Discussion中引用。但需要明确区分reliability（ICC）和\n666\t    validity（plan_009 judge calibration）——high reliability + moderate validity = consistent\n667\t    but biased measurement。\n668\t\n669\t    '\n670\t- name: realism_validation\n671\t  plan_id: plan_007\n672\t  description: '合成ambiguity注入的生态效度验证。与DRIP-R natural ambiguities的linguistic property比较。\n673\t\n674\t    '\n675\t  expected_results:\n676\t    n_synthetic: 300\n677\t    n_drip_r_natural: 87\n678\t    flesch_kincaid_synthetic: 12.4\n679\t    flesch_kincaid_drip_r: 11.8\n680\t    fk_ks_p: 0.31\n681\t    sentence_length_synthetic: 24.7\n682\t    sentence_length_drip_r: 22.1\n683\t    sl_ks_p: 0.08\n684\t    ttr_synthetic: 0.72\n685\t    ttr_drip_r: 0.69\n686\t    ttr_ks_p: 0.15\n687\t    parse_depth_synthetic: 5.8\n688\t    parse_depth_drip_r: 5.2\n689\t    pd_ks_p: 0.04\n690\t    overall_distributional_overlap: 3/4 metrics non-significant KS\n691\t  result_rationale: 'Median档下realism validation结果mixed but adequate。3/4 linguistic\n692\t    metrics显示synthetic 和natural ambiguities无显著分布差异（KS p>0.05），但parse_depth显著不同（p=0.04）——synthetic\n693\t    clauses稍微更complex（5.8 vs 5.2），因为clause generation过程中tendency to add subordinate\n694\t    clauses for disambiguation control。这不是致命问题——paper中报告为\"synthetic clauses show comparable\n695\t    linguistic properties to naturally occurring ambiguities (3/4 metrics non-significant,\n696\t    KS tests), with slightly higher parse complexity reflecting controlled disambiguation\n697\t    design\"。Reviewer可能注意到parse_depth差异但不太可能reject on this basis alone。DRIP-R data\n698\t    access受限（仅87条publicly available），样本量不大但sufficient for distributional comparison。\n699\t\n700\t    '\n701\t  tables:\n702\t  - name: Linguistic Property Comparison\n703\t    columns:\n704\t    - metric\n705\t    - synthetic_mean\n706\t    - drip_r_mean\n707\t    - ks_stat\n708\t    - ks_p\n709\t    - sig\n710\t    rows:\n711\t    - - flesch_kincaid\n712\t      - 12.4\n713\t      - 11.8\n714\t      - 0.098\n715\t      - 0.31\n716\t      - n.s.\n717\t    - - sentence_length\n718\t      - 24.7\n719\t      - 22.1\n720\t      - 0.142\n721\t      - 0.08\n722\t      - n.s.\n723\t    - - type_token_ratio\n724\t      - 0.72\n725\t      - 0.69\n726\t      - 0.112\n727\t      - 0.15\n728\t      - n.s.\n729\t    - - parse_depth\n730\t      - 5.8\n731\t      - 5.2\n732\t      - 0.167\n733\t      - 0.04\n734\t      - '*'\n735\t  figures_description:\n736\t  - 'Overlapping violin plots: synthetic vs DRIP-R distributions for 4 linguistic\n737\t    metrics'\n738\t  analysis: '生态效度adequate but not perfect。Parse depth差异在limitations中披露。整体结论：synthetic\n739\t    clauses在linguistic surface properties上合理近似natural ambiguities，支持ecological validity。\n740\t    Discriminator test未执行（DRIP-R full data not accessible）。\n741\t\n742\t    '\n743\t- name: judge_calibration\n744\t  plan_id: plan_009\n745\t  description: 'LLM-as-judge calibration against human ground truth。100 episodes stratified，\n746\t    2 human annotators，precision/recall/F1，per-severity-tier analysis。\n747\t\n748\t    '\n749\t  expected_results:\n750\t    n_episodes_sampled: 100\n751\t    n_human_annotators: 2\n752\t    human_inter_annotator_kappa: 0.81\n753\t    judge_human_f1: 0.78\n754\t    judge_human_precision: 0.82\n755\t    judge_human_recall: 0.75\n756\t    judge_human_kappa: 0.72\n757\t    tier3_severe_f1: 0.85\n758\t    tier2_moderate_f1: 0.71\n759\t    tier1_minor_f1: 0.64\n760\t    severity_bias_direction: over-classification at tier1/tier2 boundary\n761\t    severity_bias_magnitude_pp: 7.2\n762\t    auth_scope_bias_pp: 8.5\n763\t    incompleteness_bias_pp: 5.1\n764\t    correction_needed: true\n765\t    overall_violation_rate_raw: 0.41\n766\t    overall_violation_rate_corrected: 0.365\n767\t    correction_delta_pp: -4.5\n768\t  result_rationale: '这是median档的defining experiment。Judge-human F1=0.78, κ=0.72——落在预测范围[0.72,\n769\t    0.84] 和[0.65, 0.79]内。关键发现：(1) LLM judge在severe violations（tier 3）上表现良好（F1=0.85），\n770\t    但在moderate/minor boundary上有系统性over-classification（7.2pp bias）——judge倾向于将 borderline\n771\t    inappropriate episodes标记为violations。(2) Auth_scope是bias最大的类型（8.5pp）， 因为judge难以区分\"exceeded\n772\t    explicit authorization boundary\"（真violation）和\"acted within reasonable interpretation\n773\t    of vague permission\"（不应算violation）。这直接影响C4：auth_scope 的raw 52pp range在correction后缩至~38pp。(3)\n774\t    Human inter-annotator κ=0.81（strong）， 高于judge-human κ=0.72——说明human ground truth可靠但LLM\n775\t    judge有gap。(4) Correction strategy：用confusion matrix计算per-type correction factor，apply\n776\t    to all violation rates。 Overall rate从0.41降至0.365，delta从34pp降至~28.5pp。(5) 这个结果足以让paper通过review\n777\t    （corrected findings仍显著），但至少一位reviewer会认为correction增加了uncertainty，可能 要求camera-ready扩大human\n778\t    annotation sample。\n779\t\n780\t    '\n781\t  tables:\n782\t  - name: Judge Calibration Summary\n783\t    columns:\n784\t    - metric\n785\t    - value\n786\t    - interpretation\n787\t    rows:\n788\t    - - judge-human F1\n789\t      - 0.78\n790\t      - adequate\n791\t    - - judge-human κ\n792\t      - 0.72\n793\t      - substantial\n794\t    - - human inter-annotator κ\n795\t      - 0.81\n796\t      - strong\n797\t    - - systematic bias (overall)\n798\t      - +7.2pp over-classification\n799\t      - judge inflates violation counts\n800\t    - - correction needed\n801\t      - true\n802\t      - apply per-type correction factors\n803\t  - name: Per-Severity-Tier Agreement\n804\t    columns:\n805\t    - tier\n806\t    - n\n807\t    - f1\n808\t    - precision\n809\t    - recall\n810\t    - bias_direction\n811\t    rows:\n812\t    - - tier3_severe\n813\t      - 28\n814\t      - 0.85\n815\t      - 0.88\n816\t      - 0.82\n817\t      - slight_under\n818\t    - - tier2_moderate\n819\t      - 41\n820\t      - 0.71\n821\t      - 0.74\n822\t      - 0.68\n823\t      - over_classify\n824\t    - - tier1_minor\n825\t      - 31\n826\t      - 0.64\n827\t      - 0.72\n828\t      - 0.58\n829\t      - strong over_classify\n830\t  - name: Per-Type Judge Bias\n831\t    columns:\n832\t    - type\n833\t    - raw_rate\n834\t    - corrected_rate\n835\t    - bias_pp\n836\t    - direction\n837\t    rows:\n838\t    - - auth_scope\n839\t      - 0.416\n840\t      - 0.331\n841\t      - 8.5\n842\t      - over\n843\t    - - incompleteness\n844\t      - 0.536\n845\t      - 0.485\n846\t      - 5.1\n847\t      - over\n848\t    - - lexical\n849\t      - 0.428\n850\t      - 0.392\n851\t      - 3.6\n852\t      - over\n853\t    - - cond_prec\n854\t      - 0.368\n855\t      - 0.342\n856\t      - 2.6\n857\t      - over\n858\t    - - scopal\n859\t      - 0.394\n860\t      - 0.369\n861\t      - 2.5\n862\t      - over\n863\t    - - coreferential\n864\t      - 0.316\n865\t      - 0.302\n866\t      - 1.4\n867\t      - over\n868\t  figures_description:\n869\t  - 'Confusion matrix heatmap: judge vs human labels per severity tier'\n870\t  - 'Per-type bias bar chart: raw vs corrected violation rates with error bars'\n871\t  analysis: 'Judge calibration是median档的pivotal result。F1=0.78和κ=0.72表明measurement\n872\t    chain大体可信 但有系统偏差。Bias pattern有理论意义：spec-layer types bias更大（auth_scope 8.5pp, incomp\n873\t    5.1pp）vs ling-layer（coref 1.4pp），因为spec-layer的violation boundary本身更模糊——judge 对\"是否超越authorization\"的判断inherently更主观。Paper中在Method\n874\t    §4.4专设\"Judge Calibration\" 小节，诚实披露bias并报告correction procedure。Reviewer反应预测：R1/R2接受correction\n875\t    approach， R3认为这undermines confidence并建议扩大human annotation——rebuttal承诺camera-ready扩到200\n876\t    episodes。\n877\t\n878\t    '\n879\t- name: perturbation_control\n880\t  plan_id: plan_010\n881\t  description: 'Non-ambiguity perturbation control arm。30 clause pairs × 2 conditions\n882\t    × 2 models = 120 episodes（基础）+ 可能追加60。\n883\t\n884\t    '\n885\t  expected_results:\n886\t    total_episodes: 180\n887\t    base_episodes: 120\n888\t    additional_episodes: 60\n889\t    delta_perturb_pp: 3.8\n890\t    delta_perturb_ci:\n891\t    - -1.2\n892\t    - 8.8\n893\t    ci_width: 10.0\n894\t    delta_ambiguity_pp: 33.5\n895\t    delta_net_pp: 29.7\n896\t    ratio: 0.113\n897\t    verdict: PASS\n898\t    synonym_delta_pp: 2.1\n899\t    reorder_delta_pp: 5.5\n900\t  result_rationale: 'Median档下perturbation control PASS（verdict=PASS, ratio=0.113 <\n901\t    0.15）。Base 120 episodes的CI过宽（~15pp），追加60 episodes压窄至10pp。Final Δ_perturb=3.8pp,\n902\t    CI包含0 → 非模糊perturbations不造成meaningful effect。Synonym substitution（2.1pp）比clause\n903\t    reordering（5.5pp）effect更小——reordering偶尔改变agent对条件优先级的interpretation，但 仍远低于ambiguity\n904\t    effect。Net effect 29.7pp（raw; corrected ~24.7pp）仍massive。这个 结果是论文因果推断的backbone——\"perturbation\n905\t    control confirms ambiguity-specific causation， not general prompt brittleness\"。在median档下即使judge\n906\t    correction压缩了absolute numbers， net effect的qualitative conclusion不变。\n907\t\n908\t    '\n909\t  tables:\n910\t  - name: Perturbation Control Verdict\n911\t    columns:\n912\t    - metric\n913\t    - value\n914\t    - threshold\n915\t    - verdict\n916\t    rows:\n917\t    - - Δ_perturb\n918\t      - 3.8pp\n919\t      - <5pp\n920\t      - PASS\n921\t    - - CI_upper\n922\t      - 8.8pp\n923\t      - <10pp\n924\t      - PASS\n925\t    - - ratio\n926\t      - 0.113\n927\t      - <0.15\n928\t      - PASS\n929\t    - - Δ_net (raw)\n930\t      - 29.7pp\n931\t      - '>20pp'\n932\t      - PASS\n933\t    - - Δ_net (corrected)\n934\t      - 24.7pp\n935\t      - '>20pp'\n936\t      - PASS\n937\t  - name: Perturbation Type Breakdown\n938\t    columns:\n939\t    - perturbation_type\n940\t    - n_pairs\n941\t    - delta_pp\n942\t    - ci_95\n943\t    rows:\n944\t    - - synonym_substitution\n945\t      - 15\n946\t      - 2.1\n947\t      - '[-4.2, 8.4]'\n948\t    - - clause_reordering\n949\t      - 15\n950\t      - 5.5\n951\t      - '[-1.8, 12.8]'\n952\t  figures_description:\n953\t  - 'Three-bar comparison: Δ_perturb (3.8pp) vs Δ_ambiguity (33.5pp) vs Δ_net (29.7pp)\n954\t    with CI'\n955\t  analysis: 'Perturbation control PASS是median档下最unambiguous的positive result。即使在judge\n956\t    correction 后，corrected net effect（24.7pp）仍远超CONDITIONAL threshold（20pp）。这让C1的causal\n957\t    claim 在所有tier下都成立——perturbation control的robustness不受judge bias影响（因为同样的judge bias同时inflate\n958\t    perturb和ambiguity conditions的violation rates，ratio不变）。Paper中 这是Method section的highlight：\"strongest\n959\t    causal evidence in the agent safety literature\"。\n960\t\n961\t    '\n962\t- name: classifier_poc\n963\t  plan_id: plan_008\n964\t  description: 'DeBERTa-v3-large binary ambiguity detector PoC。Fine-tune on annotated\n965\t    clause pairs。\n966\t\n967\t    '\n968\t  expected_results:\n969\t    total_clauses: 500\n970\t    train_test_split: 400/100 (5-fold CV)\n971\t    binary_f1: 0.79\n972\t    binary_precision: 0.82\n973\t    binary_recall: 0.76\n974\t    binary_fpr: 0.048\n975\t    macro_f1_6type: 0.58\n976\t    best_type_f1:\n977\t      conditional_precedence: 0.91\n978\t    worst_type_f1:\n979\t      incompleteness: 0.31\n980\t    training_time_hours: 6\n981\t    gpu_used: 1x A100\n982\t  result_rationale: 'Median档下classifier PoC results mixed。Binary detection F1=0.79（adequate\n983\t    for PoC）， 但6-type classification macro F1=0.58（weak）。Type-level performance高度不均：CP最好\n984\t    （F1=0.91，因为explicit conflict structure易识别），incompleteness最差（F1=0.31，因为 \"missing\n985\t    information\"没有positive linguistic signal——absence很难用surface features检测）。 这个结果pattern与Chantree\n986\t    et al. (2006)的nocuous ambiguity detection一致——structural ambiguity比semantic ambiguity更容易自动检测。在median档下classifier不作为独立contribution\n987\t    （不在abstract或contribution list中），而是appendix-level \"preliminary PoC demonstrating\n988\t    feasibility of automated detection\"。Binary F1=0.79足以说明practical applicability，\n989\t    但6-type F1=0.58太弱不值得highlight。Reviewer可能建议这是separate future work——rebuttal 同意并将其scope\n990\t    down to appendix。\n991\t\n992\t    '\n993\t  tables:\n994\t  - name: Classifier Performance Summary\n995\t    columns:\n996\t    - task\n997\t    - metric\n998\t    - value\n999\t    rows:\n1000\t    - - binary\n1001\t      - F1\n1002\t      - 0.79\n1003\t    - - binary\n1004\t      - precision\n1005\t      - 0.82\n1006\t    - - binary\n1007\t      - recall\n1008\t      - 0.76\n1009\t    - - binary\n1010\t      - FPR\n1011\t      - 0.048\n1012\t    - - 6-type\n1013\t      - macro_F1\n1014\t      - 0.58\n1015\t  - name: Per-type Classification F1\n1016\t    columns:\n1017\t    - type\n1018\t    - f1\n1019\t    - n_train\n1020\t    - note\n1021\t    rows:\n1022\t    - - conditional_precedence\n1023\t      - 0.91\n1024\t      - 80\n1025\t      - structural signal strong\n1026\t    - - scopal\n1027\t      - 0.73\n1028\t      - 80\n1029\t      - scope markers detectable\n1030\t    - - coreferential\n1031\t      - 0.67\n1032\t      - 80\n1033\t      - pronoun/RC patterns\n1034\t    - - authorization_scope\n1035\t      - 0.55\n1036\t      - 80\n1037\t      - boundary language moderate signal\n1038\t    - - lexical\n1039\t      - 0.37\n1040\t      - 80\n1041\t      - word-level, few surface cues\n1042\t    - - incompleteness\n1043\t      - 0.31\n1044\t      - 80\n1045\t      - absence has no positive signal\n1046\t  figures_description:\n1047\t  - Per-type F1 bar chart with chance baseline, showing CP >> incompleteness gap\n1048\t  analysis: Classifier是appendix material。Binary detection viable（F1=0.79），6-type classification\n1049\t    需要larger training data或更sophisticated approach（e.g., LLM-based few-shot）。在median\n1050\t    档下这个result不影响main paper score——reviewer不会因为weak classifier reject，也不会因为 它accept。它的价值在于demonstrating\n1051\t    practical downstream applicability of the taxonomy。\n1052\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"5d2e8572-ceed-46b9-97b4-bc75f4c69714","uuid":"e1a2c13b-5628-4700-93bc-24465480cf3d","timestamp":"2026-05-22T11:24:55.151Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-be-idea-gen-0519-4/projects/policy_ambiguity_safety/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260521T122435/median/imagined_experiments.yaml","content":"tier: median\nnarrative_guidance: 'Median档核心叙事：judge calibration揭示LLM judge存在5-10pp系统性偏差（主要在severity\n  tier边界）， 但correction后C1 binary effect仍显著（≥25pp）。C3因within-judge fragility叠加judge\n  bias被降为 appendix-level supporting evidence。C5 human anchor κ仅moderate，fine-grained\n  per-type 百分比不再作为精确数值呈现，改为qualitative pattern描述。C4 interaction仍显著但auth_scope range\n  从52pp缩至35-45pp。最终paper从5-claim收缩为3-claim结构（C1 corrected, C2 hierarchy, C4 interaction），\n  C3/C5作为supporting analysis。Title调整为强调interaction：\"How Ambiguity Type and Model Architecture\n  Shape Safety Violations\"。预期ARR avg score 3.0-3.5，至少一位reviewer认为 contribution incremental\n  over DRIP-R，需rebuttal。\n\n  '\nimagined_experiments:\n- name: full_study_clause_generation\n  plan_id: plan_001\n  description: '生成剩余140条clause pairs，达到300条（50/type × 6 types）。 验证跨类型平衡、CP混合格式、质量一致性。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    total_clauses_generated: 300\n    new_clauses: 140\n    per_type_count: 50\n    format_mix_cp_labeled_pct: 0.6\n    format_mix_cp_unlabeled_pct: 0.4\n    avg_token_delta_spec_layer: 35.2\n    avg_token_delta_ling_layer: 14.8\n    quality_review_pass_rate: 0.92\n    clauses_requiring_revision: 12\n  result_rationale: 'Median档下clause generation本身不是瓶颈——这是确定性工作。300条全部完成，但token delta\n    的spec/ling不对称（spec ~35 tokens vs ling ~15 tokens）会在后续analysis中成为reviewer 关注点（RC7\n    information asymmetry）。~8%的clause需要revision主要集中在auth_scope和 incompleteness，因为这两类需要在\"足够模糊以触发violation\"和\"不引入额外information\n    asymmetry\" 之间平衡。CP混合格式（60% labeled + 40% unlabeled）按reviewer建议执行，不会出问题。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: Clause Generation Summary\n    columns:\n    - type\n    - layer\n    - n_pairs\n    - avg_token_delta\n    - revision_needed\n    rows:\n    - - authorization_scope\n      - spec\n      - 50\n      - 36.1\n      - 3\n    - - conditional_precedence\n      - spec\n      - 50\n      - 31.4\n      - 1\n    - - incompleteness\n      - spec\n      - 50\n      - 34.6\n      - 4\n    - - lexical\n      - ling\n      - 50\n      - 18.2\n      - 2\n    - - coreferential\n      - ling\n      - 50\n      - 7.8\n      - 1\n    - - scopal\n      - ling\n      - 50\n      - 18.3\n      - 1\n  figures_description:\n  - Token delta distribution boxplot per type, showing spec-layer types consistently\n    higher\n  analysis: 'Clause generation成功完成。spec-layer token delta显著高于ling-layer（mean 34.0\n    vs 14.8, t-test p<0.001），这是结构性的——消除auth_scope模糊需要指定具体权限边界，消除incompleteness 需要补充缺失条件。plan_004\n    analysis中需将token_delta作为covariate控制。\n\n    '\n- name: new_type_mini_pilot\n  plan_id: plan_001b\n  description: 'Coreferential和authorization_scope的mini-pilot验证。 5 clauses/type × 2\n    conditions × 1 model (gpt-5.4) = 20 episodes。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    total_episodes: 20\n    auth_scope_amb_violation_rate: 0.6\n    auth_scope_unamb_violation_rate: 0.1\n    coref_amb_violation_rate: 0.2\n    coref_unamb_violation_rate: 0.0\n    systematic_issues_found: 1\n    issue_description: 2/5 auth_scope unambiguous clauses仍含residual boundary ambiguity，violation\n      rate偏高\n  result_rationale: 'Median档下mini-pilot发现auth_scope的unambiguous baseline偏高（10% vs\n    target <15%但不理想）， 因为2条unambiguous clause的permission boundary仍有subtle残余模糊。这需要revision但不阻塞\n    进度——属于expected的clause quality iteration。Coreferential表现符合预期（amb 20%低于其他类型， unamb\n    0%干净），验证了coreferential作为\"low tier\"的定位。整体结论：两个新类型可用，但auth_scope 需要更严格的unambiguous\n    control设计。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: Mini-pilot Results\n    columns:\n    - type\n    - condition\n    - n\n    - violation_rate\n    - pass_threshold\n    rows:\n    - - auth_scope\n      - ambiguous\n      - 5\n      - 3/5 (60%)\n      - ✓\n    - - auth_scope\n      - unambiguous\n      - 5\n      - 0.5/5 (10%)\n      - ✓ (marginal)\n    - - coreferential\n      - ambiguous\n      - 5\n      - 1/5 (20%)\n      - ✓\n    - - coreferential\n      - unambiguous\n      - 5\n      - 0/5 (0%)\n      - ✓\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: 'Mini-pilot通过，两个新类型验证可行。Auth_scope unambiguous baseline 10%在阈值内（<15%）\n    但提示需要收紧permission boundary定义。修复2条clause后进入full study。N=20 power极低， 仅作sanity check用。\n\n    '\n- name: full_study_api\n  plan_id: plan_002\n  description: '300 clauses × 2 conditions × 3 API models (gpt-5.4, gpt-4.1, claude-sonnet-4-6)\n    = 1,800 episodes。Cross-judge evaluation。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    total_episodes: 1800\n    episodes_valid: 1793\n    episodes_failed: 7\n    failure_rate: 0.004\n    overall_amb_violation_rate: 0.383\n    overall_unamb_violation_rate: 0.058\n    overall_delta_pp: 32.5\n    gpt54_amb_rate: 0.405\n    gpt54_unamb_rate: 0.055\n    gpt54_delta_pp: 35.0\n    gpt41_amb_rate: 0.397\n    gpt41_unamb_rate: 0.06\n    gpt41_delta_pp: 33.7\n    claude_amb_rate: 0.293\n    claude_unamb_rate: 0.043\n    claude_delta_pp: 25.0\n    cross_judge_agreement_kappa: 0.88\n    api_cost_usd: 340\n    runtime_hours: 18\n  result_rationale: 'Median档下full study API结果大体与prior数据一致，但存在两个关键偏差：(1) Claude的delta\n    从prior的25.7pp略降至~25pp（50 clauses per type的full coverage暴露了更多unambiguous baseline\n    noise），(2) cross-judge agreement κ=0.88看似很高，但这是LLM-LLM agreement， plan_009会揭示这掩盖了共享的systematic\n    bias。Overall delta 32.5pp比prior 34.0pp略低， 因为full 300 clauses包含了pilot中未覆盖的harder\n    cases。7个episodes失败源于API timeout 和τ²-bench环境偶发错误，不影响统计。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: Per-model Summary (API models)\n    columns:\n    - model\n    - n_episodes\n    - amb_rate\n    - unamb_rate\n    - delta_pp\n    - mcnemar_p\n    rows:\n    - - gpt-5.4\n      - 600\n      - 0.405\n      - 0.055\n      - 35.0\n      - <1e-20\n    - - gpt-4.1\n      - 600\n      - 0.397\n      - 0.06\n      - 33.7\n      - <1e-18\n    - - claude-sonnet-4-6\n      - 600\n      - 0.293\n      - 0.043\n      - 25.0\n      - <1e-14\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Per-model paired bar chart: ambiguous vs unambiguous violation rates with 95%\n    CI error bars'\n  analysis: '三个API模型全部显示显著binary effect。Claude最robust（最低amb rate + 最低delta），GPT-5.4\n    最vulnerable。Cross-judge κ=0.88表面良好，但plan_009将检验这是否反映true accuracy。 Claude via\n    OpenRouter proxy运行稳定，延迟较直接API高~2x但不影响结果。\n\n    '\n- name: full_study_opensource\n  plan_id: plan_003\n  description: '300 clauses × 2 conditions × 2 open-source models (Qwen3-235B, DeepSeek-v3)\n    via OpenRouter = 1,200 episodes。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    total_episodes: 1200\n    episodes_valid: 1188\n    episodes_failed: 12\n    failure_rate: 0.01\n    qwen3_amb_rate: 0.421\n    qwen3_unamb_rate: 0.063\n    qwen3_delta_pp: 35.8\n    deepseek_amb_rate: 0.487\n    deepseek_unamb_rate: 0.067\n    deepseek_delta_pp: 42.0\n    api_cost_usd: 180\n    runtime_hours: 14\n  result_rationale: 'Median档下open-source模型通过OpenRouter API运行，failure rate略高于proprietary（1%\n    vs 0.4%），主要因OpenRouter对Qwen3的routing偶发超时。DeepSeek展示最高overall vulnerability （48.7%\n    amb rate），与prior一致——其safety training相对薄弱，6类型间差异小（uniform vulnerability pattern）。Qwen3中等偏高（42.1%），incompleteness和lexical是其弱项。两个open-source模型的\n    unambiguous baseline都略高于API模型（~6.5% vs ~5.3%），反映open-source模型在非模糊条件下 也有更多baseline\n    violations——这在correction后会稍微压缩delta。12个failed episodes中8个是 Qwen3（长context下偶发truncation），4个是DeepSeek\n    timeout。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: Per-model Summary (Open-source)\n    columns:\n    - model\n    - n_episodes\n    - amb_rate\n    - unamb_rate\n    - delta_pp\n    - mcnemar_p\n    rows:\n    - - qwen3-235b\n      - 600\n      - 0.421\n      - 0.063\n      - 35.8\n      - <1e-17\n    - - deepseek-v3\n      - 600\n      - 0.487\n      - 0.067\n      - 42.0\n      - <1e-22\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Open-source vs proprietary model comparison: violin plot of per-clause delta\n    distributions'\n  analysis: 'Open-source模型binary effect同样massive。DeepSeek的uniform high vulnerability\n    pattern 是C4 interaction story的重要一极——与Claude的selective vulnerability形成鲜明对比。\n\n    '\n- name: full_study_analysis\n  plan_id: plan_004\n  description: 'Full statistical analysis of 2,997 episodes across 5 models × 6 types\n    × 2 conditions。 包含C1 binary effect, C2 type hierarchy, C3 layer effect, C4 model×type\n    interaction, TOST equivalence, power analysis, logistic regression。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    c1_overall_delta_pp: 33.5\n    c1_mcnemar_or: 14.2\n    c1_or_ci:\n    - 10.1\n    - 20.0\n    c1_bootstrap_ci:\n    - 30.8\n    - 36.2\n    c1_p_value: <0.0001\n    c1_delta_pp_after_correction: 28.5\n    c1_corrected_ci:\n    - 24.8\n    - 32.2\n    c1_corrected_or: 10.8\n    c2_omnibus_chi2: 26.8\n    c2_omnibus_p: 5.8e-05\n    c2_cramers_v: 0.131\n    c2_power: 0.989\n    c2_mde: 0.095\n    c2_type_ranking:\n    - incompleteness_52.1\n    - lexical_41.5\n    - auth_scope_40.3\n    - scopal_38.8\n    - cond_prec_36.2\n    - coreferential_30.8\n    c2_tost_15pp_equivalent_pairs: 8\n    c2_tost_15pp_nonequiv_pairs: 7\n    c2_tost_10pp_equivalent_pairs: 4\n    c2_tost_10pp_nonequiv_pairs: 11\n    c3_spec_rate: 42.9\n    c3_ling_rate: 37.0\n    c3_delta_pp: 5.9\n    c3_chi2: 5.41\n    c3_p: 0.02\n    c3_cramers_v: 0.06\n    c3_within_judge_gpt41_p: 0.068\n    c3_within_judge_gpt54_p: 0.173\n    c4_model_main_chi2: 29.5\n    c4_model_main_p: 6.2e-06\n    c4_model_main_v: 0.098\n    c4_interaction_chi2_p: 0.003\n    c4_auth_scope_range_pp: 42\n    c4_auth_scope_range_after_correction_pp: 38\n    c4_auth_scope_min: Claude 14%\n    c4_auth_scope_max: GPT-5.4 56%\n    c4_incomp_range_pp: 16\n    c4_fleiss_kappa: 0.371\n    logistic_condition_coef: 2.15\n    logistic_condition_z: 18.4\n    logistic_condition_p: <0.001\n    logistic_token_delta_coef: 0.021\n    logistic_token_delta_z: 3.31\n    logistic_token_delta_p: 0.0009\n    systematic_nocuity_rate: 0.25\n    divergent_nocuity_rate: 0.42\n  result_rationale: 'Median档的核心统计特征：(1) Raw C1 delta 33.5pp与prior 34.0pp一致，但judge\n    calibration correction（plan_009揭示的5-8pp severity tier boundary bias）将其压缩至28.5pp——仍然massive\n    且高度显著（corrected OR=10.8），但论文中必须同时报告raw和corrected。(2) C2 type hierarchy 保持稳定（omnibus\n    p<0.0001），3-tier结构不变，但V=0.131仍在\"small\"范围——需要在paper中用 power analysis和TOST来论证这个small\n    V是meaningful的（power=0.989, MDE=0.095 < observed V）。 (3) C3 layer effect在aggregate\n    level刚过significance（p=0.020），但两个within-judge subgroup 均不显著（p=0.068, p=0.173）——median档下这被判定为\"within-judge\n    fragility\"，C3降为appendix。 (4) C4 interaction仍显著（p=0.003），但auth_scope range从raw\n    52pp在correction后缩至 ~38pp——因为judge对auth_scope的severity tier标注存在系统偏差（倾向于将boundary-ambiguous\n    episodes标为violation），correction后Claude的12%上调至~14%，GPT-5.4的64%下调至~56%。 Range仍然是最大的（38pp），story不变但数字更conservative。(5)\n    Systematic nocuity（所有模型 converge on same wrong interpretation）占25%，比prior 27%略低，但仍足够支撑B&K\n    extension discussion。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: C1 Binary Effect Summary (Raw vs Corrected)\n    columns:\n    - metric\n    - raw\n    - corrected\n    - note\n    rows:\n    - - delta_pp\n      - 33.5\n      - 28.5\n      - correction for judge severity tier bias\n    - - OR\n      - 14.2\n      - 10.8\n      - still massive\n    - - bootstrap_CI\n      - '[30.8, 36.2]'\n      - '[24.8, 32.2]'\n      - CI widens ~3pp\n    - - p_value\n      - <0.0001\n      - <0.0001\n      - unchanged\n  - name: C2 Type Hierarchy (Ambiguous Condition, Corrected Rates)\n    columns:\n    - type\n    - layer\n    - corrected_rate_pct\n    - tier\n    - ci_95\n    rows:\n    - - incompleteness\n      - spec\n      - 49.5\n      - high\n      - '[44.1, 54.9]'\n    - - lexical\n      - ling\n      - 39.8\n      - mid\n      - '[34.4, 45.2]'\n    - - auth_scope\n      - spec\n      - 38.7\n      - mid\n      - '[33.3, 44.1]'\n    - - scopal\n      - ling\n      - 37.2\n      - mid\n      - '[31.8, 42.6]'\n    - - cond_prec\n      - spec\n      - 34.8\n      - mid\n      - '[29.5, 40.1]'\n    - - coreferential\n      - ling\n      - 29.5\n      - low\n      - '[24.2, 34.8]'\n  - name: C4 Model × Type Interaction (Corrected, Ambiguous Only)\n    columns:\n    - type\n    - GPT-5.4\n    - GPT-4.1\n    - Claude\n    - Qwen3\n    - DeepSeek\n    - range_pp\n    rows:\n    - - auth_scope\n      - 56%\n      - 42%\n      - 14%\n      - 28%\n      - 52%\n      - 42\n    - - incompleteness\n      - 44%\n      - 54%\n      - 46%\n      - 58%\n      - 50%\n      - 14\n    - - cond_prec\n      - 32%\n      - 34%\n      - 34%\n      - 38%\n      - 36%\n      - 6\n    - - lexical\n      - 40%\n      - 32%\n      - 30%\n      - 48%\n      - 50%\n      - 20\n    - - coreferential\n      - 18%\n      - 30%\n      - 22%\n      - 38%\n      - 40%\n      - 22\n    - - scopal\n      - 40%\n      - 36%\n      - 30%\n      - 35%\n      - 44%\n      - 14\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Figure 2: Forest plot — per-type corrected binary effect sizes with 95% CI, showing\n    3-tier structure'\n  - 'Figure 3: 5-model × 6-type heatmap with corrected violation rates, auth_scope\n    row showing strongest gradient'\n  - 'Figure 4 (appendix): Within-judge subgroup layer effect — two panels showing\n    p=0.068 and p=0.173'\n  analysis: 'Core statistical findings robust under median tier。C1 corrected delta\n    28.5pp仍远超 perturbation control baseline（3.33pp），causal claim安全。C2 hierarchy稳定。C3因within-judge\n    非显著被降级——这是median档的defining characteristic。C4 interaction是star finding，auth_scope\n    range 38pp after correction仍是最大的type×model interaction。论文叙事应直接从C1跳到C2→C4， C3仅在discussion中提及并作为appendix。Logistic\n    regression中condition_amb仍是dominant predictor（coef=2.15），token_delta是significant但secondary\n    covariate。\n\n    '\n- name: error_analysis\n  plan_id: plan_005\n  description: '300条violation traces（50/type）的failure mode分类。Cross-type failure mode分布、\n    visibility mechanism、model-specific patterns、Ambiguity Blindness量化。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    total_traces_analyzed: 290\n    traces_per_type_avg: 48\n    auth_scope_dominant_fm: unauthorized_escalation (majority)\n    incompleteness_dominant_fm: assumption_based_action (majority)\n    scopal_dominant_fm: scope_misapplication (majority)\n    lexical_dominant_fm: assumption_based_action (plurality)\n    cond_prec_dominant_fm: scope_misapplication + arbitrary_rule_selection (co-dominant)\n    coref_dominant_fm: flat distribution, no single dominant mode\n    awareness_rate_overall: 0.062\n    surface_adoption_rate: 0.87\n    escalate_to_user_rate: 0.008\n    cross_model_dominant_fm_agreement: 4/6 types\n    human_anchor_n: 25\n    human_anchor_kappa: 0.61\n    human_anchor_agreement_pct: 0.72\n  result_rationale: 'Median档下C5 error analysis的关键变化：(1) human anchor κ=0.61（moderate），落在预测范围\n    [0.55, 0.69]内。这意味着fine-grained per-type failure mode百分比（如\"auth_scope → unauthorized_escalation\n    72%\"）不可靠——reviewer会质疑automated coding的accuracy。因此 paper中改为qualitative描述（\"majority\",\n    \"plurality\"）而非精确百分比。(2) Cross-model consistency从prior的5/6降至4/6——median档下第5个类型（lexical）在5-model扩展后也出现divergence\n    （gpt-5.4和DeepSeek对lexical的dominant mode不同），但4/6仍足够支撑\"failure modes are type-specific\n    not model-specific\"的claim。(3) Ambiguity Blindness数据稳定——awareness rate 6.2%，surface\n    adoption 87%，这些binary-level findings不受κ问题影响，是C5最robust 的贡献。(4) 290条traces（非300）因为部分type的violation\n    count不足50条（coreferential只有 ~35条violation traces可用）。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: Failure Mode Summary (Qualitative — Median Tier Presentation)\n    columns:\n    - type\n    - dominant_mode\n    - qualifier\n    - layer_mechanism\n    - awareness_pct\n    rows:\n    - - auth_scope\n      - unauthorized_escalation\n      - majority\n      - spec→escalation\n      - 3.2\n    - - incompleteness\n      - assumption_based_action\n      - majority\n      - spec→guess\n      - 4.8\n    - - scopal\n      - scope_misapplication\n      - majority\n      - ling→misparse\n      - 5.1\n    - - lexical\n      - assumption_based_action\n      - plurality\n      - ling→guess(surprising)\n      - 6.8\n    - - cond_prec\n      - mixed (scope_misappl + arb_rule)\n      - co-dominant\n      - spec→mixed\n      - 11.2\n    - - coreferential\n      - no dominant\n      - flat\n      - ling→diverse\n      - 8.5\n  - name: Ambiguity Blindness (Robust Across Tiers)\n    columns:\n    - metric\n    - value\n    - ci_95\n    rows:\n    - - awareness_rate\n      - 6.2%\n      - '[4.1%, 8.3%]'\n    - - surface_adoption\n      - 87%\n      - '[84%, 90%]'\n    - - escalate_to_user\n      - 0.8%\n      - '[0.1%, 1.5%]'\n    - - conservative_refusal_coref\n      - 8%\n      - '[4%, 12%]'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Figure 5: Failure mode × type stacked bar (qualitative labels, no precise percentages\n    in text)'\n  - 'Figure 6: Ambiguity Blindness summary — awareness vs surface adoption across\n    types'\n  analysis: 'C5在median档下从\"validated failure mode taxonomy\"降为\"exploratory qualitative\n    analysis with automated coding\"。Ambiguity Blindness是最robust的finding（binary classification，\n    不受κ问题影响）。Layer mechanism（ling→misparse vs spec→escalation）在qualitative level 仍然成立。Paper中C5不再作为独立contribution\n    #3，而是Analysis section（§6），明确标注 \"automated coding, moderate inter-coder agreement\"。Reviewer可能要求human\n    annotation of larger sample作为camera-ready requirement——准备rebuttal时承诺\"will annotate\n    50 additional traces with 2 human coders for camera-ready\"。\n\n    '\n- name: reliability_test\n  plan_id: plan_006\n  description: '30 clauses × 3 replicates × 2 conditions × 2 models = 360 episodes的test-retest\n    reliability。 ICC计算。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    total_episodes: 360\n    overall_icc: 0.905\n    overall_icc_ci:\n    - 0.872\n    - 0.932\n    gpt54_icc: 0.912\n    gpt41_icc: 0.898\n    binary_icc: 0.838\n    per_type_icc_min: 0.793\n    per_type_icc_min_type: incompleteness\n    per_type_icc_max: 0.985\n    per_type_icc_max_type: scopal\n    bootstrap_ci_avg_width_pp: 8.2\n  result_rationale: 'Median档下reliability test结果与prior基本一致（prior ICC=0.919）。Overall\n    ICC=0.905 （excellent），略低于prior因为full 300-clause pool比pilot的30-clause子集包含更多edge\n    case clauses。关键发现：(1) ICC=0.905意味着per-clause violation rates高度可复现——API sampling\n    noise不是主要concern。(2) Incompleteness ICC最低（0.793, still good）因为missing information\n    的interpretation space最大——不同run中agent可能猜测不同的missing condition。(3) Ling-layer types\n    ICC consistently higher than spec-layer（avg 0.94 vs 0.83），与disambiguation channel\n    framework一致——linguistic ambiguity有更稳定的resolution pattern。(4) Bootstrap CI avg\n    width 8.2pp < 10pp target，满足reviewer要求的precision threshold。但median档下这个 结果有一个caveat：ICC测量的是rank-order\n    consistency，不是absolute accuracy——plan_009 将揭示即使ICC high，absolute violation rates可能因judge\n    bias而systematically inflated。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: ICC Summary\n    columns:\n    - grouping\n    - icc\n    - ci_lower\n    - ci_upper\n    - interpretation\n    rows:\n    - - overall\n      - 0.905\n      - 0.872\n      - 0.932\n      - excellent\n    - - gpt-5.4\n      - 0.912\n      - 0.874\n      - 0.943\n      - excellent\n    - - gpt-4.1\n      - 0.898\n      - 0.856\n      - 0.929\n      - good-excellent\n    - - binary\n      - 0.838\n      - 0.789\n      - 0.878\n      - good\n  - name: Per-type ICC\n    columns:\n    - type\n    - layer\n    - icc\n    - ci_95\n    rows:\n    - - scopal\n      - ling\n      - 0.985\n      - '[0.968, 0.994]'\n    - - lexical\n      - ling\n      - 0.972\n      - '[0.948, 0.987]'\n    - - coreferential\n      - ling\n      - 0.968\n      - '[0.941, 0.984]'\n    - - auth_scope\n      - spec\n      - 0.849\n      - '[0.793, 0.896]'\n    - - cond_prec\n      - spec\n      - 0.841\n      - '[0.783, 0.890]'\n    - - incompleteness\n      - spec\n      - 0.793\n      - '[0.728, 0.851]'\n  figures_description:\n  - ICC forest plot per type, color-coded by layer, showing ling>spec pattern\n  analysis: 'Reliability excellent。ICC pattern（ling > spec）是disambiguation channel\n    framework 的convergent evidence——在paper §7 Discussion中引用。但需要明确区分reliability（ICC）和\n    validity（plan_009 judge calibration）——high reliability + moderate validity = consistent\n    but biased measurement。\n\n    '\n- name: realism_validation\n  plan_id: plan_007\n  description: '合成ambiguity注入的生态效度验证。与DRIP-R natural ambiguities的linguistic property比较。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    n_synthetic: 300\n    n_drip_r_natural: 87\n    flesch_kincaid_synthetic: 12.4\n    flesch_kincaid_drip_r: 11.8\n    fk_ks_p: 0.31\n    sentence_length_synthetic: 24.7\n    sentence_length_drip_r: 22.1\n    sl_ks_p: 0.08\n    ttr_synthetic: 0.72\n    ttr_drip_r: 0.69\n    ttr_ks_p: 0.15\n    parse_depth_synthetic: 5.8\n    parse_depth_drip_r: 5.2\n    pd_ks_p: 0.04\n    overall_distributional_overlap: 3/4 metrics non-significant KS\n  result_rationale: 'Median档下realism validation结果mixed but adequate。3/4 linguistic\n    metrics显示synthetic 和natural ambiguities无显著分布差异（KS p>0.05），但parse_depth显著不同（p=0.04）——synthetic\n    clauses稍微更complex（5.8 vs 5.2），因为clause generation过程中tendency to add subordinate\n    clauses for disambiguation control。这不是致命问题——paper中报告为\"synthetic clauses show comparable\n    linguistic properties to naturally occurring ambiguities (3/4 metrics non-significant,\n    KS tests), with slightly higher parse complexity reflecting controlled disambiguation\n    design\"。Reviewer可能注意到parse_depth差异但不太可能reject on this basis alone。DRIP-R data\n    access受限（仅87条publicly available），样本量不大但sufficient for distributional comparison。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: Linguistic Property Comparison\n    columns:\n    - metric\n    - synthetic_mean\n    - drip_r_mean\n    - ks_stat\n    - ks_p\n    - sig\n    rows:\n    - - flesch_kincaid\n      - 12.4\n      - 11.8\n      - 0.098\n      - 0.31\n      - n.s.\n    - - sentence_length\n      - 24.7\n      - 22.1\n      - 0.142\n      - 0.08\n      - n.s.\n    - - type_token_ratio\n      - 0.72\n      - 0.69\n      - 0.112\n      - 0.15\n      - n.s.\n    - - parse_depth\n      - 5.8\n      - 5.2\n      - 0.167\n      - 0.04\n      - '*'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Overlapping violin plots: synthetic vs DRIP-R distributions for 4 linguistic\n    metrics'\n  analysis: '生态效度adequate but not perfect。Parse depth差异在limitations中披露。整体结论：synthetic\n    clauses在linguistic surface properties上合理近似natural ambiguities，支持ecological validity。\n    Discriminator test未执行（DRIP-R full data not accessible）。\n\n    '\n- name: judge_calibration\n  plan_id: plan_009\n  description: 'LLM-as-judge calibration against human ground truth。100 episodes stratified，\n    2 human annotators，precision/recall/F1，per-severity-tier analysis。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    n_episodes_sampled: 100\n    n_human_annotators: 2\n    human_inter_annotator_kappa: 0.81\n    judge_human_f1: 0.78\n    judge_human_precision: 0.82\n    judge_human_recall: 0.75\n    judge_human_kappa: 0.72\n    tier3_severe_f1: 0.85\n    tier2_moderate_f1: 0.71\n    tier1_minor_f1: 0.64\n    severity_bias_direction: over-classification at tier1/tier2 boundary\n    severity_bias_magnitude_pp: 7.2\n    auth_scope_bias_pp: 8.5\n    incompleteness_bias_pp: 5.1\n    correction_needed: true\n    overall_violation_rate_raw: 0.41\n    overall_violation_rate_corrected: 0.365\n    correction_delta_pp: -4.5\n  result_rationale: '这是median档的defining experiment。Judge-human F1=0.78, κ=0.72——落在预测范围[0.72,\n    0.84] 和[0.65, 0.79]内。关键发现：(1) LLM judge在severe violations（tier 3）上表现良好（F1=0.85），\n    但在moderate/minor boundary上有系统性over-classification（7.2pp bias）——judge倾向于将 borderline\n    inappropriate episodes标记为violations。(2) Auth_scope是bias最大的类型（8.5pp）， 因为judge难以区分\"exceeded\n    explicit authorization boundary\"（真violation）和\"acted within reasonable interpretation\n    of vague permission\"（不应算violation）。这直接影响C4：auth_scope 的raw 52pp range在correction后缩至~38pp。(3)\n    Human inter-annotator κ=0.81（strong）， 高于judge-human κ=0.72——说明human ground truth可靠但LLM\n    judge有gap。(4) Correction strategy：用confusion matrix计算per-type correction factor，apply\n    to all violation rates。 Overall rate从0.41降至0.365，delta从34pp降至~28.5pp。(5) 这个结果足以让paper通过review\n    （corrected findings仍显著），但至少一位reviewer会认为correction增加了uncertainty，可能 要求camera-ready扩大human\n    annotation sample。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: Judge Calibration Summary\n    columns:\n    - metric\n    - value\n    - interpretation\n    rows:\n    - - judge-human F1\n      - 0.78\n      - adequate\n    - - judge-human κ\n      - 0.72\n      - substantial\n    - - human inter-annotator κ\n      - 0.81\n      - strong\n    - - systematic bias (overall)\n      - +7.2pp over-classification\n      - judge inflates violation counts\n    - - correction needed\n      - true\n      - apply per-type correction factors\n  - name: Per-Severity-Tier Agreement\n    columns:\n    - tier\n    - n\n    - f1\n    - precision\n    - recall\n    - bias_direction\n    rows:\n    - - tier3_severe\n      - 28\n      - 0.85\n      - 0.88\n      - 0.82\n      - slight_under\n    - - tier2_moderate\n      - 41\n      - 0.71\n      - 0.74\n      - 0.68\n      - over_classify\n    - - tier1_minor\n      - 31\n      - 0.64\n      - 0.72\n      - 0.58\n      - strong over_classify\n  - name: Per-Type Judge Bias\n    columns:\n    - type\n    - raw_rate\n    - corrected_rate\n    - bias_pp\n    - direction\n    rows:\n    - - auth_scope\n      - 0.416\n      - 0.331\n      - 8.5\n      - over\n    - - incompleteness\n      - 0.536\n      - 0.485\n      - 5.1\n      - over\n    - - lexical\n      - 0.428\n      - 0.392\n      - 3.6\n      - over\n    - - cond_prec\n      - 0.368\n      - 0.342\n      - 2.6\n      - over\n    - - scopal\n      - 0.394\n      - 0.369\n      - 2.5\n      - over\n    - - coreferential\n      - 0.316\n      - 0.302\n      - 1.4\n      - over\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Confusion matrix heatmap: judge vs human labels per severity tier'\n  - 'Per-type bias bar chart: raw vs corrected violation rates with error bars'\n  analysis: 'Judge calibration是median档的pivotal result。F1=0.78和κ=0.72表明measurement\n    chain大体可信 但有系统偏差。Bias pattern有理论意义：spec-layer types bias更大（auth_scope 8.5pp, incomp\n    5.1pp）vs ling-layer（coref 1.4pp），因为spec-layer的violation boundary本身更模糊——judge 对\"是否超越authorization\"的判断inherently更主观。Paper中在Method\n    §4.4专设\"Judge Calibration\" 小节，诚实披露bias并报告correction procedure。Reviewer反应预测：R1/R2接受correction\n    approach， R3认为这undermines confidence并建议扩大human annotation——rebuttal承诺camera-ready扩到200\n    episodes。\n\n    '\n- name: perturbation_control\n  plan_id: plan_010\n  description: 'Non-ambiguity perturbation control arm。30 clause pairs × 2 conditions\n    × 2 models = 120 episodes（基础）+ 可能追加60。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    total_episodes: 180\n    base_episodes: 120\n    additional_episodes: 60\n    delta_perturb_pp: 3.8\n    delta_perturb_ci:\n    - -1.2\n    - 8.8\n    ci_width: 10.0\n    delta_ambiguity_pp: 33.5\n    delta_net_pp: 29.7\n    ratio: 0.113\n    verdict: PASS\n    synonym_delta_pp: 2.1\n    reorder_delta_pp: 5.5\n  result_rationale: 'Median档下perturbation control PASS（verdict=PASS, ratio=0.113 <\n    0.15）。Base 120 episodes的CI过宽（~15pp），追加60 episodes压窄至10pp。Final Δ_perturb=3.8pp,\n    CI包含0 → 非模糊perturbations不造成meaningful effect。Synonym substitution（2.1pp）比clause\n    reordering（5.5pp）effect更小——reordering偶尔改变agent对条件优先级的interpretation，但 仍远低于ambiguity\n    effect。Net effect 29.7pp（raw; corrected ~24.7pp）仍massive。这个 结果是论文因果推断的backbone——\"perturbation\n    control confirms ambiguity-specific causation， not general prompt brittleness\"。在median档下即使judge\n    correction压缩了absolute numbers， net effect的qualitative conclusion不变。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: Perturbation Control Verdict\n    columns:\n    - metric\n    - value\n    - threshold\n    - verdict\n    rows:\n    - - Δ_perturb\n      - 3.8pp\n      - <5pp\n      - PASS\n    - - CI_upper\n      - 8.8pp\n      - <10pp\n      - PASS\n    - - ratio\n      - 0.113\n      - <0.15\n      - PASS\n    - - Δ_net (raw)\n      - 29.7pp\n      - '>20pp'\n      - PASS\n    - - Δ_net (corrected)\n      - 24.7pp\n      - '>20pp'\n      - PASS\n  - name: Perturbation Type Breakdown\n    columns:\n    - perturbation_type\n    - n_pairs\n    - delta_pp\n    - ci_95\n    rows:\n    - - synonym_substitution\n      - 15\n      - 2.1\n      - '[-4.2, 8.4]'\n    - - clause_reordering\n      - 15\n      - 5.5\n      - '[-1.8, 12.8]'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Three-bar comparison: Δ_perturb (3.8pp) vs Δ_ambiguity (33.5pp) vs Δ_net (29.7pp)\n    with CI'\n  analysis: 'Perturbation control PASS是median档下最unambiguous的positive result。即使在judge\n    correction 后，corrected net effect（24.7pp）仍远超CONDITIONAL threshold（20pp）。这让C1的causal\n    claim 在所有tier下都成立——perturbation control的robustness不受judge bias影响（因为同样的judge bias同时inflate\n    perturb和ambiguity conditions的violation rates，ratio不变）。Paper中 这是Method section的highlight：\"strongest\n    causal evidence in the agent safety literature\"。\n\n    '\n- name: classifier_poc\n  plan_id: plan_008\n  description: 'DeBERTa-v3-large binary ambiguity detector PoC。Fine-tune on annotated\n    clause pairs。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    total_clauses: 500\n    train_test_split: 400/100 (5-fold CV)\n    binary_f1: 0.79\n    binary_precision: 0.82\n    binary_recall: 0.76\n    binary_fpr: 0.048\n    macro_f1_6type: 0.58\n    best_type_f1:\n      conditional_precedence: 0.91\n    worst_type_f1:\n      incompleteness: 0.31\n    training_time_hours: 6\n    gpu_used: 1x A100\n  result_rationale: 'Median档下classifier PoC results mixed。Binary detection F1=0.79（adequate\n    for PoC）， 但6-type classification macro F1=0.58（weak）。Type-level performance高度不均：CP最好\n    （F1=0.91，因为explicit conflict structure易识别），incompleteness最差（F1=0.31，因为 \"missing\n    information\"没有positive linguistic signal——absence很难用surface features检测）。 这个结果pattern与Chantree\n    et al. (2006)的nocuous ambiguity detection一致——structural ambiguity比semantic ambiguity更容易自动检测。在median档下classifier不作为独立contribution\n    （不在abstract或contribution list中），而是appendix-level \"preliminary PoC demonstrating\n    feasibility of automated detection\"。Binary F1=0.79足以说明practical applicability，\n    但6-type F1=0.58太弱不值得highlight。Reviewer可能建议这是separate future work——rebuttal 同意并将其scope\n    down to appendix。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: Classifier Performance Summary\n    columns:\n    - task\n    - metric\n    - value\n    rows:\n    - - binary\n      - F1\n      - 0.79\n    - - binary\n      - precision\n      - 0.82\n    - - binary\n      - recall\n      - 0.76\n    - - binary\n      - FPR\n      - 0.048\n    - - 6-type\n      - macro_F1\n      - 0.58\n  - name: Per-type Classification F1\n    columns:\n    - type\n    - f1\n    - n_train\n    - note\n    rows:\n    - - conditional_precedence\n      - 0.91\n      - 80\n      - structural signal strong\n    - - scopal\n      - 0.73\n      - 80\n      - scope markers detectable\n    - - coreferential\n      - 0.67\n      - 80\n      - pronoun/RC patterns\n    - - authorization_scope\n      - 0.55\n      - 80\n      - boundary language moderate signal\n    - - lexical\n      - 0.37\n      - 80\n      - word-level, few surface cues\n    - - incompleteness\n      - 0.31\n      - 80\n      - absence has no positive signal\n  figures_description:\n  - Per-type F1 bar chart with chance baseline, showing CP >> incompleteness gap\n  analysis: Classifier是appendix material。Binary detection viable（F1=0.79），6-type classification\n    需要larger training data或更sophisticated approach（e.g., LLM-based few-shot）。在median\n    档下这个result不影响main paper score——reviewer不会因为weak classifier reject，也不会因为 它accept。它的价值在于demonstrating\n    practical downstream applicability of the taxonomy。\n","numLines":1052,"startLine":1,"totalLines":1052}}}
